From: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 13:47:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mm-damon-core-introduce-damos_quota_goal-complement-fix

fix comment tpyo, per Gutierrez

Signed-off-by: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
Cc: Gutierrez Asier <gutierrez.asier@huawei-partners.com>
Cc: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/core.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/core.c b/mm/damon/core.c
index 1ab5154511e6..0d27f08b350e 100644
--- a/mm/damon/core.c
+++ b/mm/damon/core.c
@@ -3267,7 +3267,7 @@ static void damos_set_quota_goal_current_value(struct damon_ctx *c,
 	if (!goal->complement)
 		return;
 
-	/* updte current_value to complemented value */
+	/* update current_value to complemented value */
 
 	/* for user_input, users set complemented value on their own */
 	if (goal->metric == DAMOS_QUOTA_USER_INPUT)
